OL,3,GNEWSAPlaid Cymru seeks deal to secure
OL,4,Aits first Welsh government budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlaid Cymru has warned of potential
OL,7,Fspending cuts as it prepares to publish
OL,8,Fits first full Welsh government budget
OL,9,Fon Tuesday.
OL,11,FThe party faces its biggest test in
OL,12,Fgovernment yet as Finance Minister Elin
OL,13,FJones will have to convince political
OL,14,Fopponents to back her tax and spending
OL,15,Fplans.
OL,17,FWith no overall majority, Plaid needs
OL,18,Fother parties to help pass the budget
OL,19,Fin a Senedd vote due to happen next
OL,20,FFebruary.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
