OL,3,GNEWSAPlaid Cymru seeks deal to secure
OL,4,Aits first Welsh government budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe impact of inflation caused by a
OL,7,Frise in energy costs is predicted to
OL,8,Feat into available funding, with
OL,9,Fanalysis from Cardiff University saying
OL,10,Fthe "outlook is bleak".
